WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.914
As I've said, Ginger wasn't terribly friendly toward me at first.

2
00:00:05.915 --> 00:00:11.990
But the longer we worked together, the better we got along.

3
00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:16.377
One warm afternoon we were out in the orchard.

4
00:00:16.378 --> 00:00:20.844
Ginger and I stood under the big chestnut tree while the other horses grazed.

5
00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:25.887
I told her about my life before coming to Birtwick Park.

6
00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:28.987
"You're lucky," she said when I finished.

7
00:00:28.988 --> 00:00:33.058
"If I'd grown up with your Farmer Grey, I might have a good temper too.

8
00:00:33.059 --> 00:00:36.184
But I'm afraid it's too late for me."

9
00:00:36.185 --> 00:00:39.560
"What do you mean?" I asked.

10
00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:44.058
"My life has been very different from yours," she said.

11
00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:48.456
"Before coming here, no one was ever kind to me.

12
00:00:48.457 --> 00:00:54.439
I was taken from my mother as early as possible and put in with several other young horses.

13
00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.723
We had food and shelter, but that was all.

14
00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:01.993
There were no kind words or pats like you had."

15
00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:07.413
"That's too bad," I said, feeling sorry for her.

16
00:01:07.414 --> 00:01:14.576
"Yes. And you just told me that your master chased away a boy who threw rocks at you," she said.

17
00:01:14.577 --> 00:01:24.133
"Well, a whole group of boys used to throw things at us to make us run.

18
00:01:24.134 --> 00:01:27.938
And if my master ever noticed, he didn't seem to care.

19
00:01:27.939 --> 00:01:34.707
One colt even got hit in the face. The poor horse probably still has a scar."

20
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:37.488
"Oh no," I said softly.

21
00:01:37.489 --> 00:01:44.364
"At least you had a pasture to play in," I added a moment later, looking around the orchard.

22
00:01:44.365 --> 00:01:46.698
"That must have been nice."

23
00:01:46.699 --> 00:01:49.390
"I suppose so," Ginger said.

24
00:01:49.391 --> 00:01:53.619
"But when it was time for my training, things got much worse."

25
00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.805
"Do you mean when you had to wear a bit?" I asked.

26
00:01:56.806 --> 00:02:00.286
"It took me a while to get used to that."

27
00:02:00.287 --> 00:02:02.424
She swished her tail.

28
00:02:02.425 --> 00:02:05.382
"I mean all of it.

29
00:02:05.383 --> 00:02:09.883
When the men came to catch me in the field, they were in a hurry.

30
00:02:09.884 --> 00:02:17.476
They chased me into a corner, then one of them grabbed my mane and another grabbed my nose.

31
00:02:17.477 --> 00:02:22.481
They held me still while a third man put on my halter.

32
00:02:22.482 --> 00:02:28.127
Then they all dragged me off to the stable, hitting me when I didn't go fast enough."

33
00:02:28.128 --> 00:02:30.831
There was more to Ginger's story.

34
00:02:30.832 --> 00:02:35.312
She explained how she had been shut up in a stall day after day.

35
00:02:35.313 --> 00:02:38.790
The men had handled her roughly while training her.

36
00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:45.625
They never let her understand what they wanted before forcing her to do things.

37
00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:53.451
Often they made her run around at the end of a long rope until she was completely exhausted.

38
00:02:53.452 --> 00:03:01.254
When she didn't behave perfectly while being ridden, they put a painful, new bit in her mouth.

39
00:03:01.255 --> 00:03:05.067
"What a terrible way to get trained," I said.

40
00:03:05.068 --> 00:03:07.258
Ginger snorted in agreement.

41
00:03:07.259 --> 00:03:11.123
Things didn't get any better once her training was finished.

42
00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:14.235
Her first master sold her to a horse dealer.

43
00:03:14.236 --> 00:03:20.029
"The dealer wanted me to match another chestnut horse," she said.

44
00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:24.987
"He drove us together for a while, and then sold us to a rich gentleman in London.

45
00:03:24.988 --> 00:03:29.415
Our new owner liked to drive with a very tight checkrein."

46
00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:32.502
"What's a checkrein?" I asked.

47
00:03:32.503 --> 00:03:35.635
"You're lucky not to know," Ginger said.

48
00:03:35.636 --> 00:03:39.931
"It's an extra rein that forces a horse to hold her head up very high.

49
00:03:39.932 --> 00:03:44.966
I like to toss my head and hold it high, but it's tiring to be forced to do it."

50
00:03:44.967 --> 00:03:50.832
I didn't really understand what she meant. But it sounded very unpleasant.

51
00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:53.948
I stayed quiet as she continued her story.

52
00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:57.957
"My new master used a harsh bit as well," she said.

53
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:03.091
"And we often had to stand for hours waiting for the mistress outside a party.

54
00:04:03.092 --> 00:04:08.495
If I dared to stamp my hooves or move, the coachman whipped me."

55
00:04:08.496 --> 00:04:11.587
"How terrible!" I exclaimed.

56
00:04:11.588 --> 00:04:16.267
"Soon I began to kick or bite whenever anyone came to harness me.

57
00:04:16.268 --> 00:04:22.868
I was miserable and sore all the time. One day I couldn't take any more.

58
00:04:22.869 --> 00:04:26.362
When they hitched me, I started to jump and kick.

59
00:04:26.363 --> 00:04:30.963
I soon broke free, and that was the end of that place."

60
00:04:30.964 --> 00:04:34.168
"Is that when you came here?" I asked.

61
00:04:34.169 --> 00:04:40.839
"No. I was sold to a different gentleman whose groom was impatient and cruel.

62
00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:47.606
If I didn't do as he ordered right away, he hit me with a broom or whatever else was handy.

63
00:04:47.607 --> 00:04:53.367
One day I bit him. Soon after that I was sold again, and ended up here."

64
00:04:53.368 --> 00:04:55.784
It was a very sad tale.

65
00:04:55.785 --> 00:05:04.043
When she was finished telling me about her past, we just stood there for a while, watching the other horses.

66
00:05:04.044 --> 00:05:10.392
But the longer we all lived at Birtwick Park, the calmer and more relaxed Ginger became.

67
00:05:10.393 --> 00:05:12.557
The men noticed it too.

68
00:05:12.558 --> 00:05:18.929
"That horse is getting much better," James said one day after Ginger let him rub her forehead.

69
00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:22.788
"She'll be as good as Black Beauty soon," John agreed.

70
00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:31.535
"Kindness is all she wanted after all."

